{
 "points": [
  {
   "id": "P1.1",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Stage 2 gets double training and inference; controls for longer training, cascade, matched params missing",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.2",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Lower WER expected from any better separation; doesn't support semantic claim",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.3",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Stage 2 trained on stage-1 outputs over fitted training data, causing mismatch",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.4",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "AVSR freezing, gradient flow and speaker matching in multi-speaker mixtures unstated",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.5",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Mixed reproduced and copied baselines; CSFNet uses heavier AVSR pipeline with external data",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.6",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Auto-AVSR pretrained on LRS2/LRS3; overlap with test sets undiscussed",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.7",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Unclear whether memory and time include AVSR and both passes; pretrain column mixes sizes",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.8",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Stray 'MAVINet' name in Sec. 4.4.1",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.9",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Large PESQ/SI-SDRi gains against copied baselines with possibly different protocols",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.10",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Noisy-condition results do not separate coarse and fine stages",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.11",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "MST is TF-GridNet with extra branches; SP fusion is simple MLP/concat",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.12",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "SP ablation only in figure with different setup; no MST vs TF-GridNet ablation",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.13",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "No analysis showing fusion encodes speaker identity",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.14",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Caption says fusion advantage diminishes with missing visuals, contradicting graceful-decline claim",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.15",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Unstated whether visual dropout used in training or baselines evaluated under same occlusion",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.16",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "No seeds, variance or CIs; coarse-stage margin only ~0.2 dB",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.17",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Table 5 evaluates 2 s segments instead of full utterances",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.18",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Feeding first-pass estimate back is a known iterative/cascade pattern",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.19",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "No semantic feature analysis, failure analysis or listening test",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.20",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Only two passes; no test of a third pass",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.21",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Inconsistent fusion names, SI-SNRi vs SI-SDRi, mixture-number mismatch",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.22",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Data generation, losses and ablations relegated to appendix",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.1",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "Coarse-to-fine is a well-known principle; prior iterative models already follow it",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.2",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "Model size and memory over 3x IIANet; processes audio and video twice",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q2.1",
   "reviewer": "Q2",
   "text": "Approach seems to just add an extra stage; novelty limited",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q2.2",
   "reviewer": "Q2",
   "text": "3x parameters of IIANet for marginal improvement",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q2.3",
   "reviewer": "Q2",
   "text": "No analysis distinguishing stage effects from simply training twice as long",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q3.1",
   "reviewer": "Q3",
   "text": "Unclear whether missing frames are temporally aligned across speakers; misalignment handling",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q3.2",
   "reviewer": "Q3",
   "text": "No explanation for not using common attention-based fusion",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q3.3",
   "reviewer": "Q3",
   "text": "Two sequential passes may double inference time, unsuitable for low latency",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q3.4",
   "reviewer": "Q3",
   "text": "Improvements may stem from pretrained AVSR backbone rather than architecture",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q4.1",
   "reviewer": "Q4",
   "text": "Unclear whether performance from Auto-AVSR encoder or architecture; encoder-swap experiment needed",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q4.2",
   "reviewer": "Q4",
   "text": "SP fusion closely resembles CTCNet and RTFS-Net baseline and should cite them",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q4.3",
   "reviewer": "Q4",
   "text": "SP fusion should be compared with CTCNet, RTFS-Net, AVLiT, IIANet fusion",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q4.4",
   "reviewer": "Q4",
   "text": "Figure 5 colours too similar; a table would be better",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
   "id": "Q4.5",
   "reviewer": "Q4",
   "text": "RTFS-Net results missing from Table 1",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q4.6",
   "reviewer": "Q4",
   "text": "Table order unclear and best results not bolded",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
   "id": "Q4.7",
   "reviewer": "Q4",
   "text": "Unclear whether Table 2 is coarse+fine or coarse-only; coarse-only cost missing",
   "minor": false
  }
